:: Deadwood Reblooms Pool Party Vow []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'pool'>><<schooleffects>><<effects>>
<<set _pool to maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').pool_party>>
<<if !_pool.vowReady>>
  <span class='blue'><i><<lanSwitch 'Not tonight.' '今晚不行。'>></i></span>
<<elseif !_pool.once('with:Robin:Sydney')>>
  <span class='blue'><i><<lanSwitch 'You have already spent time together tonight.' '你们三个今晚已经一起待过了。'>></i></span>
<<else>>
  <<run statusCheck('Robin')>><<run statusCheck('Sydney')>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      A storeroom off the changing rooms, and the door closes behind the three of you. Robin sits beside you and holds your hand. "This is better," Robin says, glancing at the closed door. "It was getting crowded out there."
      <br><br>
      Sydney sits on your other side. "We have a little time," Sydney says, smiling at you. "Unless you'd rather go back?"
    <<option 'CN'>>
      更衣室旁的一间储藏室，门在你们三人身后关上。罗宾在你身边坐下，握住你的手。“这里好多了，”罗宾看了一眼关上的门，“外面太挤了。”
      <br><br>
      悉尼在你另一侧坐下，朝你笑了笑。“我们还有一点时间。还是说，你想回去了？”
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<clearnpc>><<npc Robin 1>><<npc Sydney 2>><<person1>>
  <<consensual>><<set $consensual to 1>><<neutral 1>>
  <<set $enemyno to 2>><<set $enemynomax to 2>><<maninit>><<npcexpose>>
  <<set $enemytrust += 800>><<set $enemyarousalmax to 1000>>
  <<deadwood-reblooms-pool-party-witness vow 'Deadwood Reblooms Pool Party Vow Sex' Robin Sydney>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if !$combat>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Back to the pool', '回到泳池'] 'School Pool'>><<set $LifeSimulation.pool_party.selected to null>><</lanLink>>
<</if>>

