:: Deadwood Reblooms Pool Party Group []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'pool'>><<schooleffects>><<effects>>
<<set _pool to maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').pool_party>>
<<if !_pool.groupAllowed>>
  <span class='blue'><i><<lanSwitch 'Nobody is in the mood for that now.' '现在没人有这个兴致。'>></i></span>
<<elseif !_pool.once('with:Whitney:group')>>
  <span class='blue'><i><<lanSwitch 'You have already done this tonight.' '今晚已经一起待过了。'>></i></span>
<<else>>
  <<set $pronoun to C.npc.Whitney.pronoun>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Whitney does not ask. Whitney hooks a foot around your ankle and drags you into the deep end, where the students who came with Whitney are already waiting. "Watch," Whitney tells them, and they do.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      惠特尼根本不问。<<he>>用脚勾住你的脚踝，把你拖进深水区，跟<<he>>一起来的那些学生已经等在那里。“看着，”惠特尼对他们说，他们就看着。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <!-- 匿名学生占 0-2，惠特尼占 3，所以传 4。 -->
  <<clearnpc>><<generatey1>><<generatey2>><<generatey3>><<npc Whitney 4>><<person1>>
  <<consensual>><<set $consensual to 1>><<neutral 1>>
  <<set $enemyno to 4>><<set $enemynomax to 4>><<maninit>><<npcexpose>>
  <<set $enemytrust += 600>><<set $enemyarousalmax to 1200>>
  <<deadwood-reblooms-pool-party-witness group 'Deadwood Reblooms Pool Party Group Sex' Whitney>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if !$combat>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Back to the pool', '回到泳池'] 'School Pool'>><<set $LifeSimulation.pool_party.selected to null>><</lanLink>>
<</if>>

