<!-- 凯拉尔多人场：PC + 凯拉尔 + 另一位恋人。惠特尼被 householdRefusal 硬性排斥，不会出现在这里。 -->
:: Deadwood Reblooms Pool Party Kylar Group []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'pool'>><<schooleffects>><<effects>>
<<set _pool to maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').pool_party>>
<<set _mate to $LifeSimulation.pool_party.selected>>
<<if !_mate or !_pool.kylarPartners.includes(_mate)>>
  <span class='blue'><i><<lanSwitch 'Not tonight.' '今晚不行。'>></i></span>
<<elseif !_pool.once('with:Kylar:' + _mate)>>
  <span class='blue'><i><<lanSwitch 'You have already spent time together tonight.' '你们三个今晚已经一起待过了。'>></i></span>
<<else>>
  <<run statusCheck('Kylar')>><<run statusCheck(_mate)>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You take Kylar by the wrist and lead Kylar to where the light thins, and you do not let go until the third set of footsteps follows. Kylar looks past you at the other and then back, and Kylar's grip on your sleeve is the only part of Kylar that has stopped shaking.
      <br><br>
      "I can do this," Kylar says, to you rather than to the other. "If it is what you want. Tell me what you want and I will do it."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你攥住凯拉尔的手腕，把凯拉尔带到灯光稀薄的地方，直到第三个人的脚步声跟上来，你才松手。凯拉尔越过你看向另一个人，又转回来，唯一不再发抖的地方是抓着你的那只手。
      <br><br>
      “我可以做到，”凯拉尔说，这句话是对你说的，不是对另一个人。“只要是你想要的。告诉我，你要我做什么。”
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<clearnpc>><<npc Kylar 1>><<npc _mate 2>><<person1>>
  <<consensual>><<set $consensual to 1>><<neutral 1>>
  <<set $enemyno to 2>><<set $enemynomax to 2>><<maninit>><<npcexpose>>
  <<set $enemytrust += 900>><<set $enemyarousalmax to 1100>>
  <<npcincr Kylar dom -1>><<ldom>>
  <<deadwood-reblooms-pool-party-witness kgroup 'Deadwood Reblooms Pool Party Kylar Group Sex' Kylar _mate>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if !$combat>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Back to the pool', '回到泳池'] 'School Pool'>><<set $LifeSimulation.pool_party.selected to null>><</lanLink>>
<</if>>

